# totp.px 测试：RFC 4226 HOTP / RFC 6238 TOTP 官方向量 + base32 路径
import "../registry/totp/0.1.0/totp.px"
def expect(cond, msg):
    if not cond:
        print("FAIL: " + msg)
        exit(1)
def main():
    var key = bytes("12345678901234567890")
    # RFC 4226 附录 D：HOTP 6 位向量（counter 0..9）
    var expect_codes = ["755224", "287082", "359152", "969429", "338314",
                        "254676", "287922", "162583", "399871", "520489"]
    var i = 0
    while i < 10:
        expect(otp_hotp_raw(key, i, 6).unwrap() == expect_codes[i], "hotp [" + str(i) + "]=" + expect_codes[i])
        i += 1
    # base32 路径与 raw 一致（"12345678901234567890" 的 RFC 4648 base32）
    var b32 = "GEZDGNBVGY3TQOJQGEZDGNBVGY3TQOJQ"
    var low32 = "gezdgnbvgy3tqojqgezdgnbvgy3tqojq"
    i = 0
    while i < 5:
        expect(otp_hotp(b32, i, 6).unwrap() == expect_codes[i], "hotp b32 [" + str(i) + "]")
        expect(otp_hotp(low32, i, 6).unwrap() == expect_codes[i], "hotp b32 小写 [" + str(i) + "]")
        i += 1
    # RFC 6238 附录 B：TOTP 8 位向量（SHA1，step=30）
    var tv = [[59, "94287082"], [1111111109, "07081804"], [1111111111, "14050471"],
              [1234567890, "89005924"], [2000000000, "69279037"], [20000000000, "65353130"]]
    var j = 0
    while j < len(tv):
        expect(otp_totp(b32, 8, tv[j][0]).unwrap() == tv[j][1], "totp T=" + str(tv[j][0]))
        j += 1
    # 自定义 step：step=30 与默认一致
    expect(otp_totp_step(b32, 8, 1234567890, 30).unwrap() == "89005924", "totp step=30")
    # verify：±window 内应通过；错误码不通过
    expect(otp_verify(b32, "89005924", 8, 1234567890, 1), "verify ok")
    expect(otp_verify(b32, "89005924", 8, 1234567890 - 20, 1), "verify 漂移 20s ok")
    expect(otp_verify(b32, "00000000", 8, 1234567890, 1) == false, "verify 错误码 false")
    expect(otp_verify(b32, "89005924", 8, 1234567890, 0), "verify window=0 ok")
    # 错误路径
    expect(otp_b32_decode("!").is_err(), "b32 非法字符 Err")
    expect(otp_hotp_raw(key, 0, 5).is_err(), "digits 越界 Err")
    expect(otp_hotp(b32, -1, 6).is_err(), "counter 负 Err")
    print("totp: PASS")
    return Ok(0)